<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>String utility methods and cryptographically secure random generators.</para>

<para>Provides case-insensitive substring checks, prefix/suffix tests, alphanumeric validation, and secure random string/token/bytes generation.</para>

<para>Note: This class is required directly by the bootstrap (<link linkend="_class_8root_8php">class.root.php</link>) because the autoloader itself depends on <link linkend="_class_util_string_1a7b420042518bbb2ba19f81bd3e138d71">UtilString\startWith()</link>.</para>

<para>Usage: <literallayout><computeroutput><link linkend="_class_util_string_1a7b420042518bbb2ba19f81bd3e138d71">UtilString::startWith</link>(<emphasis role="stringliteral">&apos;foobar&apos;</emphasis>,&#32;<emphasis role="stringliteral">&apos;foo&apos;</emphasis>);&#32;<emphasis role="comment">//&#32;true</emphasis>
<link linkend="_class_util_string_1a8947bb42d36178ac24f7f2168cdf7230">UtilString::random</link>(16);&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;&#32;<emphasis role="comment">//&#32;cryptographically&#32;secure&#32;random&#32;string</emphasis>
</computeroutput></literallayout> </para>
